# 📚 Recursion & Backtracking (Part 1) - Introduction to Recursion

## 📌 Introduction

**Recursion** is a programming technique in which a function calls itself to solve smaller instances of the same problem.

Instead of solving the entire problem at once, recursion breaks it into smaller subproblems until a **Base Case** is reached.

Recursion is widely used in:

- Tree Traversal
- Graph Algorithms
- Dynamic Programming
- Backtracking
- Divide & Conquer
- Mathematical Problems

